    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Ceramite Sentinels",
    "summary": "Whenever an **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** model of yours attacks, if its unit is in a terrain feature, the attack can re-roll 1s to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) and 1s to [Wound](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls).\n\nWhile all of these hold, an **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** unit of yours gets the **ENTRENCHED** keyword:\n\n- the unit is in a terrain feature\n- the unit has not been set up this turn\n- none of its models has moved over 3\" this turn",
